-# The list below is created with
-# find workdir/UnpackedTarball/fontconfig/conf.d/ -name "*.conf" | LC_COLLATE=C sort | sed -e 's/^/    /' -e 's/$/ \\/' -e 's/workdir\/UnpackedTarball\/fontconfig\///'
+# Install fontconfig's DEFAULT conf.d set, not every file in its source conf.d/. That
+# directory is fontconfig's catalogue of AVAILABLE configs (conf.avail): its own install
+# links only the defaults below (conf.d/meson.build `conf_links`, plus the preferred
+# hinting `slight`, sub-pixel `none` and bitmap `no-except-emoji` choices of
+# meson.options; 35-lang-normalize.conf is a template, not linked). Installing all of them
+# enabled 05-reset-dirs-sample.conf, whose <reset-dirs/> discards every <dir> in
+# fonts.conf, and contradictory pairs (hinting full AND none, bitmaps yes AND no).
